[SddmGreeterTheme]
Name=Terminal Red
Description=Minimal black/red terminal SDDM theme. Braille ASCII art header, animated Russian/Japanese loneliness poetry marquees on both screen edges, auto-detects all installed sessions (X11 + Wayland), correct X11/WAYLAND badge via SDDM named roles. Hard corners, Terminus font aesthetic.
